ASNO^계좌일련번호^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
LNKD_TLMS_MNNO^연계전문관리번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO_PIP^실명확인번호PIP^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="323" _ulen="245" >

PROS_CLS_CODE^처리 구분 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
LNKD_TLMS_MNNO^연계전문관리번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
IF_FLNM^IF성명^20^0^0^0^0^0^0
UI_MNY_ACNT_OPNG_CHD_YN^UI다수계좌개설자여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
UI_BNKB_NMPR_YN^UI통장명의인여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
UI_FRD_NMPR_YN^UI사기명의인여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

